      "\n",
      "  Total: 3 successful OFD steps, 0 failed steps\n",
      "  GF(2) nullity: 0  |  final maximum bond: 1\n",
      "\n",
      "FINAL EXPECTATION VALUE\n",
      "  <IXXIII>  CAMPS 0.707106781187  |  exact 0.707106781187\n",
      "  Absolute error: 2.24e-16\n",
      "\n",
      "HOW THE CALCULATION WORKS\n",
      "  1. Start from |0...0>; move each T through its preceding Cliffords.\n",
      "  2. Encode the resulting Pauli strings as X/Z bits and compute GF(2) nullity.\n",
      "  3.1 T1 (IIXIII): use a free |0> pivot, disentangle with controlled Paulis; bond 1.\n",
      "  3.2 T2 (IIIXII): use a free |0> pivot, disentangle with controlled Paulis; bond 1.\n",
      "  3.3 T3 (IIIIXI): use a free |0> pivot, disentangle with controlled Paulis; bond 1.\n",
      "  4. Conjugate IXXIII by C† and contract it with the MPS tensors.\n",
      "  5. Check against a dense 6-qubit calculation (verification only).\n"
     ]
